<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Macmed says still in acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Macmed says still in acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macmed Health Care Ltd said on Wednesday it was still in talks regarding potential acqusitions and strategic alliances which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings. The company first cautioned on the talks on May 16.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
